# --- exceptions to the broad rules above -------------------------------------
# `*.txt` would otherwise swallow the pinned dependency list, and `results*/`
# and `*.png` the audit data and figures that the report cites.  A negation on
# a directory is required before git will even descend into it.
!requirements*.txt
!ewald_audit/results/
!ewald_audit/**/*.txt
!ewald_audit/**/*.png
